# Utility to do various dev tasks:
#
# zbynek-aws-tool - various AWS manipulation utilities:
#   dynamodb convert: converts DynamoDb type based output to simple JSON
#   get-log: retrieves a full CloudWatch log stream, formatted as "<UTC timestamp> <message>" lines
#             (--tail to keep polling for new events, like tail -f; --last N to start with only the last N events)
#   cloudformation remove-part: removes resources from a CloudFormation stack, keeping the physical resources by default
#              (sets DeletionPolicy: Retain, then removes them from the template; --delete to delete them too;
#              --dry-run to preview)
